	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Animation",
	"Description": "Feature animation decoupled from the main anim graph: linked anim layers that take over the pose when their feature asks (override layer seam), and anim sets (layer class + presentation montage overrides) chosen per feature tag (Anim.Set.*) from prioritized sources, with skin variants picked by cosmetic tags (Anim.Trait.*). Presentation only: simulation, timelines and hitboxes always read the reference montage. No GAS, Network Prediction or Mover.",
